msgctxt "92"
msgid "So my dad was getting threats from this scary guy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Apparently he made up this crazy story, saying my dad\r\n"
"<Color:7>dented up his car in Hatsumachi<Color:Default>. Then he forced him to\r\n"
"sign an agreement saying he'd pay all for the damages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Now there are a whole bunch of scary dudes showing up at our\r\n"
"house every single day, looking for the money..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"That's not right at all... Shouldn't you talk to the police\r\n"
"about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"We tried... but since my dad signed the agreement,\r\n"
"apparently there's nothing they can do about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Ever since then, my mom's been a nervous wreck... We even\r\n"
"have to move to my grandma's house in Tokushima just to get\r\n"
"away from all the stress."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "But you promised we'd all graduate together..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I know... I'm sorry... At this rate, I probably won't be\r\n"
"able to get into the same college, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Chisato? What're you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"You know the Trevi Fountain in Italy? They say if you throw\r\n"
"a coin in there and make a wish, it'll come true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Well, this river is the Okinawan version of that,\r\n"
"so I figured I'd give it a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "What? I've never heard of anything like that before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Doesn't hurt to try, does it? I wish that we could all be\r\n"
"together forever and ever! You throw one, too, Haruko!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "O...Okay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"None of this is your fault, Haruko. Don't feel too down.\r\n"
"It's the bad guys in Hatsumachi that are at fault here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Yeah, try to cheer up, okay? I know, why don't we go get\r\n"
"something to eat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"(Sounds like some con men have a <Color:7>car<Color:Default> set up in <Color:7>Hatsumachi<Color:Default>\r\n"
"as a moneymaking scheme.)"
msgstr ""

